Bit by bit reproducible builds, dev envs and deployments.

Usage: b3 [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  eval  Evaluate the provided expression as much as possible.
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --log-level <log-level>  Verbosity level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn, error, off]
  -h, --help                   Print help information
